  m_text: "The Base Map should hold only the surface's own colour, with no light and no shadow painted in. The lights in the scene add those.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> One of the pole shadows on the wall is painted into the texture. When you move the Spot Light, which one stays where it is?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select Spot Light - move me.\n2. Move it.\n3. Open the wall's Base Map texture in the Project window.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Material chart, 2 \xB7 Everyday materials (measured base colours, without light)</color></size>"
